01:01:17,243 --> 01:01:20,309
We won't go out of here ...

215
01:01:20,309 --> 01:01:23,180
until you say your name.

216
01:01:48,708 --> 01:01:51,910
It may be that PMB is running up there as well.

217
01:01:51,910 --> 01:01:57,467
A bright light is captured by the surveillance in the room where the PMB stands.

218
01:02:10,000 --> 01:02:13,485
Show yourself like a fog here.

219
01:02:13,485 --> 01:02:16,868
Play the melody up in the other room.

220
01:02:16,868 --> 01:02:20,245
If you are there by the closet.

221
01:02:20,769 --> 01:02:26,505
I stand here thinking about a thing that feels pretty macabre ...

222
01:02:26,505 --> 01:02:28,273
When we came here earlier today ..

223
01:02:28,273 --> 01:02:31,444
So this door was closed.
No one in there.

224
01:02:31,444 --> 01:02:34,320
What is also on this door is a hasp.

225
01:02:34,320 --> 01:02:35,166
Huh?

226
01:02:35,690 --> 01:02:38,429
At the top left.

227
01:04:43,863 --> 01:04:49,880
I think you are a dark energy that has been generated in this place, of something very, very negative.

228
01:04:49,880 --> 01:04:55,722
I even think you told this man, going out in the barn and hanging you.

229
01:04:55,722 --> 01:04:56,983
Am I right there?

230
01:04:58,893 --> 01:05:00,634
And so it increases.

231
01:05:02,656 --> 01:05:05,290
It vibrates even more.

232
01:05:08,473 --> 01:05:12,918
And you try to behave as if you are a small child.

233
01:05:13,105 --> 01:05:15,120
So when the boy is to be able to talk to you ..

234
01:05:17,891 --> 01:05:30,651
But we will tell those who live here, that the boy is talking to is no little girl.
So he'll stop talking to you.

235
01:05:31,437 --> 01:05:34,569
It just lay down, the bus too.

236
01:05:34,569 --> 01:05:40,263
Okay.
If you are going to do something big and strong, so do it now.

237
01:05:40,975 --> 01:05:44,495
Because you are not the voice in this house any more.
